---
title: "Pre-Liquid Approved Sale Lifecycle (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_initialized: initialize(config)
    q_initialized --> q_active: sale is active, accepting investments
    q_active --> q_active: invest(amount, sig) - SAFT-approved investors
    q_active --> q_canceled_early: cancel() by projectAdmin (before end)
    q_active --> q_ended: end() by legionOperator or projectAdmin
    q_ended --> q_refund_period: hasEnded = true, endTime = now
    q_refund_period --> q_refund_period: individual 14-day refund windows per investor
    q_refund_period --> q_canceled_post: cancel() by projectAdmin (capital may need return)
    q_refund_period --> q_post_refund: all individual refund periods expired
    q_post_refund --> q_capital_published: publishRaisedCapital(totalRaised)
    q_capital_published --> q_capital_withdrawn: withdrawRaisedCapital() by projectAdmin
    q_capital_published --> q_tge_published: publishTgeDetails(askToken, supply, allocated)
    q_capital_withdrawn --> q_tge_published: publishTgeDetails(askToken, supply, allocated)
    q_tge_published --> q_tokens_supplied: supplyTokens() by projectAdmin
    q_tokens_supplied --> q_distribution: tokensSupplied = true
    q_distribution --> q_distribution: claimTokenAllocation(allocSig, vestSig) per investor
    q_distribution --> [*]: all investors claimed
    q_canceled_early --> q_refunds: isCanceled = true
    q_canceled_post --> q_refunds: isCanceled = true (capital returned if withdrawn)
    q_refunds --> q_refunds: withdrawInvestedCapitalIfCanceled() per investor
    q_refunds --> [*]: all investors refunded

    note right of q_active
        INV-001: No predetermined end time; sale continues until manually ended
        INV-002: Each invest() resets that investor's individual refund window
    end note

    note right of q_refund_period
        INV-003: Refund period is PER INVESTOR: lastInvestTimestamp + refundPeriodSeconds
        INV-004: MiCA regulation compliance: minimum 14-day refund window
    end note

    note right of q_capital_withdrawn
        INV-005: Capital can be withdrawn before token supply (pre-TGE operational needs)
        INV-006: After capital withdrawal, vesting term modifications prohibited
        INV-007: Cancellation after withdrawal requires return of full amount + fees
    end note

    note right of q_tokens_supplied
        INV-008: Token supply includes allocatedTokens + legionTokenFee + referrerTokenFee
        INV-009: Clone pattern used for vesting contract deployment
    end note
